' A real, empty form for the samples that draw on one, or read or set a form's
' own properties, and are run (see the `form` template in WIP.ExamplesBuild.md).
'
' Form1.tbform is its designer file, and the two name the same designer id. A form
' created in code has no designer file, and cannot be drawn on: `Load` raises 361
' and `AutoRedraw` raises -2147467259 -- so the form has to be a file of the project.

[Description("")]
[FormDesignerId("EAEAEAEA-EAEA-EAEA-EAEA-EAEAEAEAEA01")]
[PredeclaredId]
Class Form1

    Sub New()
    End Sub

End Class
